  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And canonicas þar seo ár sý þæt hi beoddern ⁊ slæpern habban magan, healdan heora mynster mid rihte ⁊ mid clænnisse, swa heora regol tæce; oððe riht is þæt he þolige þare are se ðe þæt nelle.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And canons, wherever their property admits of their having a refectory and a dormitory, shall maintain regularity and celibacy in their foundation, as their rule prescribes; otherwise it is right that he who refuses to do so should forfeit his endowment.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And canónicas þær seo ár sy, þæt hy beoddern ⁊ slæpern habban magan, healdan heora mynster mid rihte ⁊ mid clænnesse, swa heora regol tæce; oððon riht is, þæt he þolige þære are se ðe þæt nelle.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
